I remember us having a complicated and, in a sense, slick\nexchange that influenced the fate of entire companies just\na month ago.%K%P
我很清楚地记得，在一个月前我和泽嶋小姐，\n为某一企业今后的情况\n进行了相当激烈的讨论。%K%P
And yet, here we were now, arguing over the best way to\ntutor a girl with all the eloquency and nuance of a couple\nof five year olds.%K%P
而现在，我和泽嶋小姐，\n正在为某女学生的教育方针\n而进行着小学生等级的争吵。%K%P
I had to wonder... If Sawashima Himeo really was a\nuniversity student, how come she never acted like one? Did\nthat side of her even exist?%K%P
怎么说呢…『女子大学生·泽嶋姫緒』，\n与其年龄相对应的人物形象是不存在的吗？%K%P
