%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu finally found proper employment, so don't you think\nit's about time you started getting serious about that\ntoo?\d%K%P
「理君都已经再次就职了，\n夏夜小姐也差不多该…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dMe? But I'm already employed.\d%K%P
「我？\n已经再就职了哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI've been working at my old acquaintance's accounting\nfirm since last week, actually.\d%K%P
「熟人的会计事务所。\n其实从上周就开始上班了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWh-When on earth...?!\d%K%P
「什、什么时候！？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dLike I said, last week.\d%K%P
「所以说是上周」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's not what I meant!\d%K%P
「不是那个意思啦」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dDid you know?\d%K%P
「你知道吗？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dNot at all.\d%K%P
「完全不知道」%K%P
Neither did I, as awkward as that was.%K%P
虽然很难启齿，但我也…%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dNow that I think about it, I didn't see her in the house\naround noon over the past few days.\d%K%P
「说起来，最近白天都没有看见她人呢」%K%P
I was coming home during evenings, then worked a night\nshift; there was no way for my schedule to overlap with\nthe life cycle of a normal human being to begin with.%K%P
说到底，黄昏归来深夜上班，\n这样的生活状态根本和“正常”一词八竿子打不到一块儿去。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy didn't you tell us?! Aw, geez, I was so inconsiderate\ntowards you. I'm really sorry, Ms. Kaya!\d%K%P
「要说出来啊！\n啊啊真是的、对不起人啊。\n夏夜小姐对不起！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNo, um, actually, I think it's pretty odd for a landlord\nto keep celebrating the employment matters of their\ntenants.\d%K%P
「不，一般来说，\n每次有住户就职就进行庆祝的房东小姐才是不正常的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm sorry. I'm really sorry. Look, we can have a proper\nparty for you tomorrow.\d%K%P
「抱歉，真的抱歉啊？\n明天，会重新庆祝的哦？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dGeez, chill. It's not such a big deal.\d%K%P
「不用了。\n又不是什么大事」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWhen you put it like that, for some reason it makes me\nkind of sad looking at Laid-off right now...\d%K%P
「你这样说的话，\n现在正得到我们盛大庆祝的失业者立场就…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo! Out of the question! If you want to be a part of our\napartment, you will have to learn to live with a nosy and\nopinionated landlord!\d%K%P
「不行，绝对不行！\n只要成为了我们公寓的住户的话，\n就必须忍受啰嗦房东的介入～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAhaha... That's why there's no winning against you.\nRight, Osamu?\d%K%P
「啊哈哈…\n所以说还是赢不过房东小姐呢。\n是吧，理君」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMs. Kaya...\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIsn't that accounting firm...\d%K%P
「熟人的会计事务所…那是…」%K%P
The place that the president of Houei Commerce -- her\nuncle -- had found for her way back when.%K%P
邦永商会的董事长…夏夜小姐的伯父，\n为了夏夜小姐而准备的再就职的地方…%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThere's no point for me to be stubborn any longer, so...\d%K%P
「没有必要再意气用事了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
I wasn't exactly sure what she meant.%K%P
夏夜小姐的那句话，\n对于我来说，应该是没有什么意义的…%K%P
Although, I couldn't help noticing that her smile was kind\nof...%K%P
只不过她那时稍微有点敷衍了事\n又稍微混入了苦笑的态度。%K%P
...resigned and tired.%K%P
让我有一点点在意。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...H-Huh?\d%K%P
「…咦、咦？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dTch, he got up too soon.\d%K%P
「切，居然醒了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPhwahh... Oh, where are the others? Is the party over?\d%K%P
「呼啊…人少了不少嘛。\n已经解散了吗？」%K%P
I decided to ignore her whisper for now.%K%P
总之，先不要去在意刚才夏夜小姐说了什么。%K%P
...After all, I knew my life would be happier not prying\ntoo deep into why I woke up alone with her in my room.%K%P
…因为不知什么时候，我的房间居然只有两个人了，\n我想还是不要深入探究了，这也是为了我们两人好。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou dozed off, so everyone moved elsewhere. The landlord\nand the princess returned to their room, while the others\nare still partying over at Mr. Retired's place.\d%K%P
「理君睡着了，所以大家换了场地。\n房东小姐和公主散了。\n其他人在老爷子的房间」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, I'm sorry. I never had the chance to sleep today.\d%K%P
「啊～…抱歉。\n今天我几乎没睡过觉」%K%P
I got that phone call from Michihama during my sleeping\nhours.%K%P
从深夜的打工回来后，\n就在睡着的瞬间道浜商事来电话了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNow that I lost my reason for staying behind, I think\nI'll go join their afterparty. What will you do?\d%K%P
「我在这里的目的也没了，\n打算去那边喝一杯，理君怎么办？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... think I've had enough for today.\d%K%P
「我…今天还是算了」%K%P
Once again, I felt something thoroughly unnerving hidden\nin her words, but I also knew I would only be stirring up\na hornet's nest if I prodded further.%K%P
虽然从刚才夏夜小姐的话里又感到了危险的气息，\n认真你就输了，认真你就输了…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dActually, I've got to leave for work in three hours. I\nthink I'll go take a bath to have some alcohol leave my\nblood.\d%K%P
「３小时以后还有打工呢。\n现在必须先去洗澡醒醒酒」%K%P
I guess this would mark the last time I went to that night\njob.%K%P
话说回来，既然已经被正式录用了，\n那深夜的打工也就到本周为止了吧。%K%P
It was a bit unfortunate that I would be giving up right\nafter I finally got used to working the register.%K%P
收银员也好理货员也好清洁工也好，\n虽然在快成一套的时候辞掉稍有些遗憾…%K%P
I imagine the manager will be saddened by the news, since\nI was the only person available for a night shift in the\nentire shop.%K%P
店长、应该会感到沮丧的吧。\n深夜打工的基本上只有我一个人。%K%P
I still remembered his broad smile when he hired me,\nexclaiming that he could finally sleep at home.%K%P
在我申请工作时，说着『这样终于能在家里睡觉了』\n显出高兴的样子，好像给店长留下了奇怪的印象。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI see. Well, I'll be going then. Congrats on finding\nemployment, Osamu.\d%K%P
「这样啊…那，我就先去了。\n理君，祝贺你再就职」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou too, Ms. Kaya.\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐才是…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYeah. See you around.\d%K%P
「嗯…那回见了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
It felt like she's been a lot less clingy and more aloof\nthan usual as of late.%K%P
与一直以来夏夜小姐的语气比起来，\n那声道别十分干脆，也十分冷淡。%K%P
Well, I guess she was nothing if not aloof to begin with,\nbut it felt kind of different now.%K%P
不，虽然一直以来都是很冷淡的态度，\n不过总感觉话里有话，怎么说呢。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell then, I wonder what I should do now.\d%K%P
「那么…我该怎么办呢？」%K%P
I ended up missing my chance to thank everyone for the\nparty they threw for me.%K%P
到头来，因为在宴会的途中就睡着了，\n结果现在还没有好好向大家道谢。%K%P
Well, I wasn't sure how necessary it was to express that\nsentiment to Mr. Retired and the others, but I had to say\nsomething to Mitoko and Ms. Sawa-- Himeo, at least.%K%P
嘛，和老爷子他们道谢先暂时缓缓，\n至少要先向美都子和泽…姬绪道谢才行。%K%P
I had to thank Mitoko for always being there for me. And I\nhad to thank Himeo for being there for Michihama Trading.%K
感谢美都子一直以来支持着我，\n感谢姬绪小姐一直支持着道浜商事。%K
Look for Mitoko
去找美都子
Look for Himeo
去找姬绪
